{"ld": 1648, "paper": "SP656", "session": "132", "title": "Resolve, to Honor Margaret Chase Smith and Joshua Chamberlain in the National Statuary Hall Collection (TITLE CHANGE)", "sponsor_id": "s-larsen-daughtry-matthea", "cosponsor_ids": ["h-ankeles-daniel", "s-nangle-timothy", "h-sato-eleanor"], "committee_code": "EDU", "committee_name": "Education and Cultural Affairs", "summary": {"text": "Maine currently has on display in the National Statuary Hall in Washington, D.C. a statue of Hannibal Hamlin and a statue of William King. This resolve requires the Maine Arts Commission, the Maine State Museum Commission and the Maine Historic Preservation Commission to request of the Joint Committee of Congress on the Library that the statues of Hannibal Hamlin and William King be replaced with statues of Margaret Chase Smith and Joshua Chamberlain. If approval is granted, the commissions are required to replace the statues and move the Hamlin and King statues to the State House or the grounds of the State House.", "official": true, "source": "Bill text, https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0656&item=1&snum=132"}, "status": "enacted", "status_label": "Finally Passed", "final_disposition": {"label": "Finally Passed", "date": "2025-06-12", "governor_action": "Signed", "governor_action_date": "2025-06-12"}, "fiscal_status": "Not Yet Determined", "documents": [{"label": "Bill text (LD 1648)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0656&item=1&snum=132", "item": 1}, {"label": "Amendment C-A (S-202)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0656&item=2&snum=132", "item": 2}, {"label": "Amendment H-A to C-A (H-429)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0656&item=4&snum=132", "item": 4}], "amendments": [{"id": "C-A (S-202)", "description": null, "sponsor": null, "status": "Adopted by House & Senate", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP